       "text": "[table noborder=1]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Hello everyone, good news for you - an update for the Dinosaurs: Mission Dino Camp is out now addressing some issues and additional improvements. Here is the changelog for v1.10:",
